  "text": "## PART 5: Security Procedures  \n### Cash Security  \n**Vault Access:**\n- Only manager has vault code\n- Two-person rule: Manager + teller together\n- Never leave vault open unattended\n- Count cash on secure counter (not desk)  \n**Teller Drawers:**\n- Locked when teller absent\n- Counted daily\n- Discrepancies reported immediately  \n**Large Deposits/Withdrawals:**\n- >£1,000: Manager approval\n- >£5,000: CTR form filed\n- >£10,000: Internal controls check  \n---",
